#!/bin/bash
# slots/8/bfight N : fight Medusa blind. Each round: if sight returned -> re-flash camera at self first;
# find Medusa's direction from neighbors (via farlook of adjacent @), F-attack. Stop if HP < 60 or she is gone.
cd "$(dirname "$0")/../.."
for i in $(seq 1 "${1:-6}"); do
  st=$(slots/8/v | grep -oE "T:[0-9]+.*" | head -1)
  if ! echo "$st" | grep -q "Blind"; then
    slots/8/k a --why "sight returned: re-blind NOW" >/dev/null; slots/8/k y --why "camera" >/dev/null
    o=$(slots/8/k . --raw --why "at myself"); echo "REFLASH $(echo "$o" | grep -oE "T:[0-9]+.*" | head -1)"
  fi
  mf=$(slots/8/v | grep "Map feat")
  pos=$(slots/8/v | grep -oE "Terminal cursor \(x,y; usually hero when no menu\): [0-9]+,[0-9]+" | grep -oE "[0-9]+,[0-9]+")
  hx=${pos%,*}; hy=${pos#*,}
  d=""
  for c in "7 -1 -1" "8 0 -1" "9 1 -1" "4 -1 0" "6 1 0" "1 -1 1" "2 0 1" "3 1 1"; do
    set -- $c; x=$((hx+$2)); y=$((hy+$3))
    if echo "$mf" | grep -qE "@@$x,$y( |$)"; then
      desc=$(slots/8/look $x $y 2>&1 | tail -1)
      if echo "$desc" | grep -q "Medusa"; then d=$1; break; fi
    fi
  done
  [ -z "$d" ] && { echo "Medusa not adjacent"; exit 2; }
  o=$(slots/8/k F$d --really --why "fight Medusa while blind")
  echo "F$d: $(echo "$o" | sed -n 7,7p | cut -c5-80) $(echo "$o" | grep -oE "HP:[0-9]+")"
  echo "$o" | grep -qE "You kill Medusa|Medusa is destroyed|You destroy Medusa" && { echo "KILLED"; exit 0; }
  hp=$(echo "$o" | grep -oE "HP:[0-9]+" | head -1 | cut -d: -f2); [ -n "$hp" ] && [ "$hp" -lt 60 ] && { echo "LOW HP"; exit 3; }
done
